1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Episode 5 · The Contract Bedroom

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,120
One bedroom?

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,280
Yours. I'll take the couch.

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,960
A wedding isn't permission.

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:08,720
Then set the rules.

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,440
Married outside. Separate lives in here.

7
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,720
No other dates while we're married.

8
00:00:14,855 --> 00:00:18,055
My room. My phone. My business. Knock first.

9
00:00:18,135 --> 00:00:20,055
Done. Lock it if you want.

10
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:21,975
When does this end?

11
00:00:21,975 --> 00:00:25,495
My trust fund clears. We divorce. You walk away free.

12
00:00:25,655 --> 00:00:28,295
You pay the lawyers. I'm not paying to escape.

13
00:00:28,375 --> 00:00:30,840
Both of them. You won't owe a cent.

14
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,160
New clause?

15
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,080
No. And not an invitation.

16
00:00:57,245 --> 00:00:57,965
Forget something?

17
00:00:58,680 --> 00:01:01,480
That kiss at the wedding. Was it just for them?

18
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,120
What do you think?

19
00:01:08,680 --> 00:01:09,800
I want to find out.

20
00:01:15,045 --> 00:01:16,485
That's enough for tonight.

21
00:01:16,805 --> 00:01:17,365
Your call.

22
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:28,250
Private banking — Total assets: $2,400,000,000.

23
00:01:30,250 --> 00:01:32,250
To be continued

